pkg:Evidence_v1_13_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.13.0 (STORY-2 rescoped and closed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user directed dropping Quiz and using the real RDODI template's actual sections. Checked the real template source directly rather than assuming: confirmed tab list Overview/Principle Explorer/Interact/Citations/About -- Introduction/Body/References genuinely satisfied by real, already-existing mechanism, Citations already fed by STORY-1's 15 citations, Principle Explorer already fed by the 18 principles. User also asked directly why the Story was written without checking these details first -- answered honestly: the DoD was written from the procedure document's stated requirement without first verifying the specific mechanism could deliver it, a real process gap found at execution time rather than Story-writing time. While checking, found a second, unrelated real gap: all 18 PRINCIPLES' apply fields in STORY-1's own deliverable were the same templated sentence with only the label substituted, never caught by STORY-1's own structural closing checks. Rewrote all 18 with genuine, distinct, per-concept content drawn from each concept's real argument; verified programmatically (18 distinct, 0 still templated). Rescoped STORY-2's own label/wantsCapability/soThat to reflect what was actually done. Closed with real Evidence, a genuine AcceptanceCriterion, and Mode_Automated. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "85032bed9f626b718f9386574f31f08a9231b1d43b629fa61d5c6347c4f8c810"^^xsd:string .
